{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Luxview.AgainstMe","latestVersion":"0.5.122","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Real-time tactical companion for Valorant — opponent intel, tactical death maps, AI coaching, and smurf detection.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://againstme.app/eula","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Real-time tactical companion for Valorant — opponent intel, tactical death maps, AI coaching, and smurf detection.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://againstme.app/eula","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"AgainstMe is a desktop companion for Valorant that turns the seconds\nbetween rounds into a tactical edge. Click any enemy to see their top\nagents, K/D, win rate per map, and smurf risk; read aggregated death\nheatmaps across the lobby's recent matches; and get round-by-round\ncoaching tuned to your rank.\n\n100% local: match data and in-game stats are processed on your PC and\nnever transmitted. The narrow exceptions (AI coaching, opt-in Party\nSync, account sign-in) are documented in the privacy policy.\n\nFree tier covers enemy intel, round timeline, and basic coaching.\nPremium and Premium+ unlock AI debriefs, win-probability, tactical\ndeath map overlay, party sync, and higher coaching quotas.","moniker":"againstme","name":"AgainstMe","packageUrl":"https://againstme.app","publisher":"LuxView","publisherUrl":"https://againstme.app","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/JohnPitter/againstme-oficial/releases/tag/v0.5.122","tags":["valorant","gaming","esports","tactical","coaching","companion","riot"]}},"longDescription":"AgainstMe is a desktop companion for Valorant that turns the seconds\nbetween rounds into a tactical edge. Click any enemy to see their top\nagents, K/D, win rate per map, and smurf risk; read aggregated death\nheatmaps across the lobby's recent matches; and get round-by-round\ncoaching tuned to your rank.\n\n100% local: match data and in-game stats are proces